{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S03、S06、S07等段的感受短词仍然偏密，上下交替也不如Y左右分栏那样容易把叙事和听感分开扫。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用短句和【】突出每段的关键转折，扫屏时更容易抓住人物正在经历什么；感受又有不少随音乐到时出现，能把信息分散到相应的小节，而不是一次堆在屏幕上。更重要的是，X把舍不得从前的亲近、对曾受委屈的不甘、离开后的孤独，以及最终带着想念继续生活之间的心理拉扯交代得更具体，音乐感受也有更细致的层次变化。Y的完整叙述更顺畅、左右分栏更整齐，但部分心理转折和音乐细节被概括掉了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7d02948a-3228-49e4-b624-14c7d51bfa4e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T210000783055Z", "elapsed_seconds": 155.343, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:02:36.140564+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2fc1a851344dd49f9bd29106880bfae7d99ae1b100a2ef13d3f2198348385d7a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g